{"id":"vol9-03","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-03/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":437.25,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":2.66,"text":"Now turn to section 3 on page 6.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.28],["turn",0.28,0.56],["to",0.56,0.76],["section",0.76,1.0],["3",1.0,1.46],["on",1.46,1.9],["page",1.9,2.16],["6.",2.16,2.66]]},{"start":5.33,"end":5.97,"text":"Part 3.","words":[["Part",5.33,5.53],["3.",5.53,5.97]]},{"start":7.25,"end":12.39,"text":"You will hear a discussion between Fiona, who is the head of a college drama department,","words":[["You",7.25,7.45],["will",7.45,7.67],["hear",7.67,7.87],["a",7.87,8.01],["discussion",8.01,8.53],["between",8.53,9.07],["Fiona,",9.07,9.59],["who",10.31,10.47],["is",10.47,10.61],["the",10.61,10.75],["head",10.75,10.95],["of",10.95,11.07],["a",11.07,11.21],["college",11.21,11.47],["drama",11.47,11.93],["department,",11.93,12.39]]},{"start":12.97,"end":19.13,"text":"and a new tutor called Ed, who is preparing to run a voice coaching workshop for drama students.","words":[["and",12.97,13.43],["a",13.43,13.61],["new",13.61,13.83],["tutor",13.83,14.25],["called",14.25,14.69],["Ed,",14.69,14.97],["who",15.45,15.59],["is",15.59,15.69],["preparing",15.69,16.05],["to",16.05,16.35],["run",16.35,16.53],["a",16.53,16.69],["voice",16.69,16.95],["coaching",16.95,17.43],["workshop",17.43,17.99],["for",17.99,18.27],["drama",18.27,18.59],["students.",18.59,19.13]]},{"start":20.35,"end":25.07,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26.","words":[["First,",20.35,20.75],["you",21.21,21.43],["have",21.43,21.61],["some",21.61,21.79],["time",21.79,22.13],["to",22.13,22.31],["look",22.31,22.45],["at",22.45,22.59],["questions",22.59,22.97],["21",22.97,23.95],["to",23.95,24.47],["26.",24.47,25.07]]},{"start":70.72,"end":75.2,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["Now",70.72,71.06],["listen",71.06,71.38],["carefully",71.38,71.8],["and",71.8,72.38],["answer",72.38,72.64],["questions",72.64,73.14],["21",73.14,74.04],["to",74.04,74.58],["26.",74.58,75.2]]},{"start":75.2,"end":85.93,"text":"Right, Ed. Well, I'm delighted that you've joined the Drama Department. Now, part of my job is to","words":[["Right,",75.2,76.34],["Ed.",79.71,80.03],["Well,",80.37,80.55],["I'm",80.75,80.95],["delighted",80.95,81.43],["that",81.43,81.75],["you've",81.75,81.99],["joined",81.99,82.19],["the",82.19,82.39],["Drama",82.39,82.65],["Department.",82.65,83.15],["Now,",83.89,84.23],["part",84.47,84.77],["of",84.77,84.91],["my",84.91,85.09],["job",85.09,85.43],["is",85.43,85.73],["to",85.73,85.93]]},{"start":85.93,"end":91.39,"text":"support you during your probationary year. So, let's ensure that you're clear about what you'll","words":[["support",85.93,86.29],["you",86.29,86.61],["during",86.61,86.89],["your",86.89,87.13],["probationary",87.13,87.85],["year.",87.85,88.21],["So,",88.59,89.11],["let's",89.29,89.67],["ensure",89.67,90.07],["that",90.07,90.31],["you're",90.31,90.49],["clear",90.49,90.73],["about",90.73,90.97],["what",90.97,91.21],["you'll",91.21,91.39]]},{"start":91.39,"end":97.51,"text":"be doing in the first voice coaching workshop you run next week. Okay. I'll be observing you","words":[["be",91.39,91.49],["doing",91.49,91.79],["in",91.79,92.09],["the",92.09,92.25],["first",92.25,92.51],["voice",92.51,92.81],["coaching",92.81,93.23],["workshop",93.23,93.77],["you",93.77,93.99],["run",93.99,94.15],["next",94.15,94.41],["week.",94.41,94.73],["Okay.",95.01,95.45],["I'll",96.13,96.65],["be",96.65,96.79],["observing",96.79,97.19],["you",97.19,97.51]]},{"start":97.51,"end":103.43,"text":"working with the students as you show them how to project their voices on stage. I'll be","words":[["working",97.51,97.77],["with",97.77,98.01],["the",98.01,98.11],["students",98.11,98.51],["as",98.51,98.97],["you",98.97,99.15],["show",99.15,99.37],["them",99.37,99.57],["how",99.57,99.87],["to",99.87,100.09],["project",100.09,100.45],["their",100.45,100.85],["voices",100.85,101.25],["on",101.25,101.57],["stage.",101.57,101.99],["I'll",102.69,103.29],["be",103.29,103.43]]},{"start":103.43,"end":110.15,"text":"evaluating how you cope with the practical activities as well as the theory. And if all goes well,","words":[["evaluating",103.43,103.81],["how",103.81,104.35],["you",104.35,104.53],["cope",104.53,104.81],["with",104.81,105.07],["the",105.07,105.23],["practical",105.23,105.61],["activities",105.61,106.41],["as",106.41,107.03],["well",107.03,107.31],["as",107.31,107.47],["the",107.47,107.61],["theory.",107.61,108.01],["And",108.49,109.01],["if",109.01,109.31],["all",109.31,109.49],["goes",109.49,109.67],["well,",109.67,110.15]]},{"start":110.57,"end":113.83,"text":"you'll then have finished the final stage of your voice coach diploma.","words":[["you'll",110.57,110.83],["then",110.83,111.05],["have",111.05,111.23],["finished",111.23,111.49],["the",111.49,111.81],["final",111.81,112.09],["stage",112.09,112.55],["of",112.55,112.75],["your",112.75,112.89],["voice",112.89,113.15],["coach",113.15,113.45],["diploma.",113.45,113.83]]},{"start":114.39,"end":122.47,"text":"That'd be great, Fiona. Anyway, I've thought through the workshop and I've done a plan to highlight the key areas I intend to cover.","words":[["That'd",114.39,114.81],["be",114.81,114.95],["great,",114.95,115.25],["Fiona.",115.39,115.59],["Anyway,",116.39,116.71],["I've",116.99,117.19],["thought",117.19,117.49],["through",117.49,117.83],["the",117.83,118.01],["workshop",118.01,118.45],["and",118.45,118.81],["I've",118.81,118.99],["done",118.99,119.19],["a",119.19,119.35],["plan",119.35,119.69],["to",119.69,119.95],["highlight",119.95,120.33],["the",120.33,120.63],["key",120.63,120.99],["areas",120.99,121.45],["I",121.45,121.69],["intend",121.69,121.91],["to",121.91,122.17],["cover.",122.17,122.47]]},{"start":122.79,"end":124.35,"text":"Good. Let's look at your plan.","words":[["Good.",122.79,123.03],["Let's",123.45,123.79],["look",123.79,123.89],["at",123.89,123.99],["your",123.99,124.11],["plan.",124.11,124.35]]},{"start":125.47,"end":132.59,"text":"Okay, so let's see. I'm glad you've thought about seating patterns. You say you want to","words":[["Okay,",125.47,126.15],["so",126.53,126.83],["let's",126.83,127.43],["see.",127.43,127.73],["I'm",128.23,128.67],["glad",128.67,128.97],["you've",128.97,129.43],["thought",129.43,129.57],["about",129.57,129.81],["seating",129.81,130.15],["patterns.",130.15,130.61],["You",131.27,131.61],["say",131.61,131.99],["you",131.99,132.31],["want",132.31,132.45],["to",132.45,132.59]]},{"start":132.59,"end":138.99,"text":"begin with the students sitting in star-shaped patterns. That's fine. There are various seating","words":[["begin",132.59,132.87],["with",132.87,133.13],["the",133.13,133.33],["students",133.33,133.77],["sitting",133.77,134.23],["in",134.23,134.55],["star",134.55,134.99],["-shaped",134.99,135.31],["patterns.",135.31,136.07],["That's",136.47,136.95],["fine.",136.95,137.27],["There",137.73,138.05],["are",138.05,138.25],["various",138.25,138.63],["seating",138.63,138.99]]},{"start":138.99,"end":145.63,"text":"patterns you can use at this stage. I like trainees sitting cross-legged in a circle. Other people","words":[["patterns",138.99,139.39],["you",139.39,139.81],["can",139.81,139.95],["use",139.95,140.17],["at",140.17,140.31],["this",140.31,140.49],["stage.",140.49,140.87],["I",141.67,141.95],["like",141.95,142.25],["trainees",142.25,142.65],["sitting",142.65,143.11],["cross",143.11,143.47],["-legged",143.47,143.79],["in",143.79,144.17],["a",144.17,144.31],["circle.",144.31,144.71],["Other",145.07,145.31],["people",145.31,145.63]]},{"start":145.63,"end":152.07,"text":"like students in rows. But actually all these can be represented diagrammatically, which would","words":[["like",145.63,145.95],["students",145.95,146.43],["in",146.43,146.77],["rows.",146.77,147.07],["But",147.75,148.03],["actually",148.03,148.59],["all",148.59,148.89],["these",148.89,149.09],["can",149.09,149.29],["be",149.29,149.43],["represented",149.43,149.93],["diagrammatically,",149.93,151.15],["which",151.35,151.81],["would",151.81,152.07]]},{"start":152.07,"end":156.11,"text":"be clearer than going into lots of detailed explanations like you've done here.","words":[["be",152.07,152.21],["clearer",152.21,152.63],["than",152.63,152.85],["going",152.85,153.11],["into",153.11,153.43],["lots",153.43,153.67],["of",153.67,153.89],["detailed",153.89,154.25],["explanations",154.25,155.05],["like",155.05,155.47],["you've",155.47,155.73],["done",155.73,155.87],["here.",155.87,156.11]]},{"start":156.47,"end":161.03,"text":"Oh, okay. But it doesn't matter which one I use at the beginning of a workshop.","words":[["Oh,",156.47,156.85],["okay.",156.99,157.27],["But",157.99,158.27],["it",158.27,158.43],["doesn't",158.43,158.69],["matter",158.69,158.91],["which",158.91,159.17],["one",159.17,159.41],["I",159.41,159.55],["use",159.55,159.87],["at",159.87,160.03],["the",160.03,160.13],["beginning",160.13,160.45],["of",160.45,160.65],["a",160.65,160.73],["workshop.",160.73,161.03]]},{"start":161.37,"end":163.27,"text":"It's whatever you feel comfortable with.","words":[["It's",161.37,161.73],["whatever",161.73,162.05],["you",162.05,162.33],["feel",162.33,162.55],["comfortable",162.55,162.93],["with.",162.93,163.27]]},{"start":163.65,"end":168.41,"text":"Fine. So, in the initial phase, I explain the objectives of the session.","words":[["Fine.",163.65,164.13],["So,",164.41,164.57],["in",164.93,165.13],["the",165.13,165.27],["initial",165.27,165.65],["phase,",165.65,166.05],["I",166.31,166.45],["explain",166.45,166.87],["the",166.87,167.13],["objectives",167.13,167.61],["of",167.61,167.97],["the",167.97,168.11],["session.",168.11,168.41]]},{"start":168.89,"end":176.15,"text":"Okay. Then, in the first activity, you say they should quickly rise, walk briskly around","words":[["Okay.",168.89,169.31],["Then,",170.03,170.37],["in",170.57,170.73],["the",170.73,170.85],["first",170.85,171.35],["activity,",171.35,172.03],["you",172.03,172.59],["say",172.59,172.95],["they",172.95,173.19],["should",173.19,173.43],["quickly",173.43,173.85],["rise,",173.85,174.35],["walk",174.79,175.13],["briskly",175.13,175.89],["around",175.89,176.15]]},{"start":176.15,"end":179.63,"text":"the room, weaving in and out to avoid each other.","words":[["the",176.15,176.47],["room,",176.47,176.81],["weaving",177.35,177.67],["in",177.67,178.03],["and",178.03,178.13],["out",178.13,178.43],["to",178.43,178.65],["avoid",178.65,178.97],["each",178.97,179.31],["other.",179.31,179.63]]},{"start":179.63,"end":186.39,"text":"Yes, I think it's important that they don't get in each other's way, and that they learn to move within a confined space,","words":[["Yes,",179.63,180.09],["I",180.43,180.63],["think",180.63,180.83],["it's",180.83,181.09],["important",181.09,181.65],["that",181.65,181.89],["they",181.89,182.03],["don't",182.03,182.27],["get",182.27,182.45],["in",182.45,182.63],["each",182.63,182.85],["other's",182.85,183.21],["way,",183.21,183.55],["and",183.67,183.79],["that",183.79,183.99],["they",183.99,184.17],["learn",184.17,184.39],["to",184.39,184.59],["move",184.59,184.85],["within",184.85,185.23],["a",185.23,185.43],["confined",185.43,185.79],["space,",185.79,186.39]]},{"start":186.93,"end":191.17,"text":"aware of other people, but primarily concentrating on their own thoughts.","words":[["aware",186.93,187.21],["of",187.21,187.45],["other",187.45,187.61],["people,",187.61,187.99],["but",188.15,188.27],["primarily",188.27,189.05],["concentrating",189.05,189.71],["on",189.71,190.11],["their",190.11,190.31],["own",190.31,190.63],["thoughts.",190.63,191.17]]},{"start":191.49,"end":198.93,"text":"Absolutely. But in your plan, you've omitted to mention that in the second activity you will get the students to pair off.","words":[["Absolutely.",191.49,191.95],["But",192.59,192.93],["in",192.93,193.27],["your",193.27,193.45],["plan,",193.45,193.83],["you've",194.03,194.23],["omitted",194.23,194.55],["to",194.55,194.83],["mention",194.83,195.13],["that",195.13,195.39],["in",195.39,195.63],["the",195.63,195.81],["second",195.81,196.19],["activity",196.19,196.73],["you",196.73,197.15],["will",197.15,197.33],["get",197.33,197.53],["the",197.53,197.71],["students",197.71,198.05],["to",198.05,198.31],["pair",198.31,198.55],["off.",198.55,198.93]]},{"start":199.51,"end":206.11,"text":"So you need to rethink that section and include reasons why it's essential for them to listen to each other talking.","words":[["So",199.51,199.77],["you",199.77,200.03],["need",200.03,200.21],["to",200.21,200.45],["rethink",200.45,200.69],["that",200.69,201.05],["section",201.05,201.51],["and",201.51,202.23],["include",202.23,202.65],["reasons",202.65,203.07],["why",203.07,203.53],["it's",203.53,203.93],["essential",203.93,204.31],["for",204.31,204.55],["them",204.55,204.71],["to",204.71,204.91],["listen",204.91,205.17],["to",205.17,205.35],["each",205.35,205.57],["other",205.57,205.73],["talking.",205.73,206.11]]},{"start":206.11,"end":211.19,"text":"it doesn't matter what they actually say and at the same time get them to think","words":[["it",206.11,206.39],["doesn't",206.39,207.17],["matter",207.17,207.45],["what",207.45,207.69],["they",207.69,207.85],["actually",207.85,208.15],["say",208.15,208.57],["and",208.57,209.43],["at",209.43,209.55],["the",209.55,209.61],["same",209.61,209.93],["time",209.93,210.37],["get",210.37,210.71],["them",210.71,210.87],["to",210.87,211.01],["think",211.01,211.19]]},{"start":211.19,"end":215.43,"text":"about their posture because that governs their lung capacity and most","words":[["about",211.19,211.45],["their",211.45,211.69],["posture",211.69,212.11],["because",212.11,212.83],["that",212.83,213.09],["governs",213.09,213.73],["their",213.73,213.93],["lung",213.93,214.17],["capacity",214.17,214.61],["and",214.61,215.07],["most",215.07,215.43]]},{"start":215.43,"end":221.87,"text":"crucially their breathing. Right we'll do. Okay of course a common issue in the UK","words":[["crucially",215.43,215.97],["their",215.97,216.41],["breathing.",216.41,216.71],["Right",217.11,217.53],["we'll",217.53,218.13],["do.",218.13,218.37],["Okay",218.65,218.97],["of",218.97,220.01],["course",220.01,220.27],["a",220.27,220.51],["common",220.51,220.75],["issue",220.75,221.15],["in",221.15,221.47],["the",221.47,221.59],["UK",221.59,221.87]]},{"start":221.87,"end":227.87,"text":"is that we rehearse in small rooms then transfer to a larger stage so bearing","words":[["is",221.87,222.33],["that",222.33,222.51],["we",222.51,222.69],["rehearse",222.69,223.19],["in",223.19,223.35],["small",223.35,223.69],["rooms",223.69,224.23],["then",224.23,224.73],["transfer",224.73,225.29],["to",225.29,225.53],["a",225.53,225.65],["larger",225.65,225.91],["stage",225.91,226.41],["so",226.41,227.29],["bearing",227.29,227.87]]},{"start":227.87,"end":232.75,"text":"in mind that voice projection is not shouting later in the course you'll","words":[["in",227.87,228.11],["mind",228.11,228.35],["that",228.35,228.63],["voice",228.63,228.87],["projection",228.87,229.35],["is",229.35,229.69],["not",229.69,230.01],["shouting",230.01,230.69],["later",230.69,231.73],["in",231.73,231.91],["the",231.91,232.01],["course",232.01,232.35],["you'll",232.35,232.75]]},{"start":232.75,"end":234.45,"text":"need to work in a much bigger space.","words":[["need",232.75,232.95],["to",232.95,233.11],["work",233.11,233.39],["in",233.39,233.59],["a",233.59,233.71],["much",233.71,233.89],["bigger",233.89,234.17],["space.",234.17,234.45]]},{"start":235.05,"end":237.19,"text":"Does it have to be an enclosed space?","words":[["Does",235.05,235.29],["it",235.29,235.45],["have",235.45,235.69],["to",235.69,235.85],["be",235.85,236.09],["an",236.09,236.19],["enclosed",236.19,236.63],["space?",236.63,237.19]]},{"start":237.93,"end":240.39,"text":"I suppose it does, because ultimately they're","words":[["I",237.93,238.05],["suppose",238.05,238.47],["it",238.47,238.75],["does,",238.75,238.97],["because",239.01,239.31],["ultimately",239.31,240.11],["they're",240.11,240.39]]},{"start":240.39,"end":241.55,"text":"going to work in a theatre.","words":[["going",240.39,240.53],["to",240.53,240.67],["work",240.67,240.95],["in",240.95,241.07],["a",241.07,241.17],["theatre.",241.17,241.55]]},{"start":241.97,"end":244.99,"text":"Ideally an enclosed space, but there's","words":[["Ideally",241.97,242.57],["an",242.57,243.11],["enclosed",243.11,243.53],["space,",243.53,244.27],["but",244.65,244.81],["there's",244.81,244.99]]},{"start":244.99,"end":247.45,"text":"no reason why you couldn't go somewhere outdoors,","words":[["no",244.99,245.15],["reason",245.15,245.45],["why",245.45,245.73],["you",245.73,245.97],["couldn't",245.97,246.29],["go",246.29,246.49],["somewhere",246.49,246.89],["outdoors,",246.89,247.45]]},{"start":247.97,"end":251.55,"text":"although I'd avoid a very public space like a park.","words":[["although",247.97,248.45],["I'd",248.45,248.99],["avoid",248.99,249.33],["a",249.33,249.63],["very",249.63,249.83],["public",249.83,250.21],["space",250.21,250.85],["like",250.85,251.19],["a",251.19,251.29],["park.",251.29,251.55]]},{"start":251.97,"end":253.15,"text":"Right, thanks.","words":[["Right,",251.97,252.43],["thanks.",252.79,253.15]]},{"start":253.99,"end":258.39,"text":"Now your next activity on how to convey emotion on stage","words":[["Now",253.99,254.41],["your",254.41,254.67],["next",254.67,255.03],["activity",255.03,255.65],["on",255.65,256.05],["how",256.05,256.31],["to",256.31,256.53],["convey",256.53,256.95],["emotion",256.95,257.55],["on",257.55,258.03],["stage",258.03,258.39]]},{"start":258.39,"end":261.41,"text":"is fine, but your selection of texts","words":[["is",258.39,258.67],["fine,",258.67,259.03],["but",259.19,259.79],["your",259.79,260.05],["selection",260.05,260.63],["of",260.63,260.87],["texts",260.87,261.41]]},{"start":261.41,"end":264.51,"text":"for the students to experience emotional depth","words":[["for",261.41,262.09],["the",262.09,262.23],["students",262.23,262.59],["to",262.59,262.85],["experience",262.85,263.39],["emotional",263.39,264.03],["depth",264.03,264.51]]},{"start":264.51,"end":266.41,"text":"leaves a little to be desired.","words":[["leaves",264.51,265.09],["a",265.09,265.33],["little",265.33,265.53],["to",265.53,265.73],["be",265.73,265.87],["desired.",265.87,266.41]]},{"start":267.05,"end":269.75,"text":"It's not enough to include a few extracts","words":[["It's",267.05,267.43],["not",267.43,267.55],["enough",267.55,267.91],["to",267.91,268.17],["include",268.17,268.47],["a",268.47,268.65],["few",268.65,268.75],["extracts",268.75,269.75]]},{"start":269.75,"end":271.01,"text":"that you find enjoyable.","words":[["that",269.75,269.91],["you",269.91,270.09],["find",270.09,270.35],["enjoyable.",270.35,271.01]]},{"start":271.61,"end":273.87,"text":"You need to consider the different kind of emotion","words":[["You",271.61,271.93],["need",271.93,272.07],["to",272.07,272.21],["consider",272.21,272.63],["the",272.63,272.81],["different",272.81,273.05],["kind",273.05,273.33],["of",273.33,273.51],["emotion",273.51,273.87]]},{"start":273.87,"end":276.17,"text":"that each extract should present,","words":[["that",273.87,274.19],["each",274.19,274.47],["extract",274.47,275.07],["should",275.07,275.63],["present,",275.63,276.17]]},{"start":276.83,"end":279.07,"text":"from sorrow through to ecstasy.","words":[["from",276.83,277.17],["sorrow",277.17,277.81],["through",277.81,278.29],["to",278.29,278.53],["ecstasy.",278.53,279.07]]},{"start":279.71,"end":281.59,"text":"Classical stuff is all well and good,","words":[["Classical",279.71,280.25],["stuff",280.25,280.51],["is",280.51,280.73],["all",280.73,280.91],["well",280.91,281.13],["and",281.13,281.31],["good,",281.31,281.59]]},{"start":281.97,"end":284.51,"text":"but include many more contemporary sources.","words":[["but",281.97,282.37],["include",282.37,282.89],["many",282.89,283.23],["more",283.23,283.47],["contemporary",283.47,283.99],["sources.",283.99,284.51]]},{"start":284.85,"end":285.61,"text":"I understand.","words":[["I",284.85,285.13],["understand.",285.13,285.61]]},{"start":289.28,"end":291.52,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion,","words":[["Before",289.28,289.88],["you",289.88,290.16],["hear",290.16,290.38],["the",290.38,290.52],["rest",290.52,290.78],["of",290.78,290.94],["the",290.94,291.02],["discussion,",291.02,291.52]]},{"start":323.81,"end":330.09,"text":"Now, out of the 20 books you list, some are more useful than others, and I think you should","words":[["Now,",323.81,324.37],["out",324.47,324.85],["of",324.85,324.97],["the",324.97,325.09],["20",325.09,325.41],["books",325.41,325.73],["you",325.73,325.95],["list,",325.95,326.41],["some",326.95,327.21],["are",327.21,327.49],["more",327.49,327.65],["useful",327.65,328.07],["than",328.07,328.31],["others,",328.31,328.71],["and",329.03,329.37],["I",329.37,329.59],["think",329.59,329.77],["you",329.77,329.95],["should",329.95,330.09]]},{"start":330.09,"end":334.01,"text":"flag up the disadvantages so that people don't waste money buying them.","words":[["flag",330.09,330.37],["up",330.37,330.63],["the",330.63,330.73],["disadvantages",330.73,331.45],["so",331.45,332.01],["that",332.01,332.21],["people",332.21,332.43],["don't",332.43,332.73],["waste",332.73,333.01],["money",333.01,333.39],["buying",333.39,333.75],["them.",333.75,334.01]]},{"start":334.75,"end":336.31,"text":"Take vocal instruction.","words":[["Take",334.75,335.17],["vocal",335.17,335.65],["instruction.",335.65,336.31]]},{"start":336.85,"end":342.27,"text":"I know I recommended it for you to read for its historical perspective, but bear in mind","words":[["I",336.85,337.07],["know",337.07,337.27],["I",337.27,337.51],["recommended",337.51,337.91],["it",337.91,338.15],["for",338.15,338.31],["you",338.31,338.53],["to",338.53,338.77],["read",338.77,339.03],["for",339.03,339.29],["its",339.29,339.45],["historical",339.45,339.99],["perspective,",339.99,340.71],["but",341.17,341.53],["bear",341.53,341.85],["in",341.85,341.97],["mind",341.97,342.27]]},{"start":342.27,"end":350.59,"text":"it was written 30 years ago and it shows. Yeah agreed. I thought improve your accent was interesting","words":[["it",342.27,342.43],["was",342.43,342.69],["written",342.69,343.07],["30",343.07,343.47],["years",343.47,343.75],["ago",343.75,344.07],["and",344.07,344.57],["it",344.57,344.69],["shows.",344.69,345.01],["Yeah",345.41,345.75],["agreed.",345.75,346.69],["I",347.71,347.87],["thought",347.87,348.15],["improve",348.15,348.83],["your",348.83,349.11],["accent",349.11,349.61],["was",349.61,350.03],["interesting",350.03,350.59]]},{"start":350.59,"end":356.15,"text":"but it's very narrow in its outlook don't you think? Well I'm not sure it's interesting","words":[["but",350.59,351.25],["it's",351.25,351.43],["very",351.43,351.59],["narrow",351.59,352.15],["in",352.15,352.41],["its",352.41,352.55],["outlook",352.55,352.89],["don't",352.89,353.23],["you",353.23,353.37],["think?",353.37,353.65],["Well",354.07,354.47],["I'm",354.47,354.93],["not",354.93,355.05],["sure",355.05,355.31],["it's",355.31,355.57],["interesting",355.57,356.15]]},{"start":356.73,"end":362.61,"text":"and another one you need to warn people about is the Actors Handbook. It's an expensive book","words":[["and",356.73,357.07],["another",357.07,357.45],["one",357.45,357.69],["you",357.69,357.83],["need",357.83,358.01],["to",358.01,358.17],["warn",358.17,358.41],["people",358.41,358.75],["about",358.75,359.11],["is",359.11,359.51],["the",359.51,359.71],["Actors",359.71,360.19],["Handbook.",360.19,360.79],["It's",361.39,361.65],["an",361.65,361.73],["expensive",361.73,362.11],["book",362.11,362.61]]},{"start":362.61,"end":368.89,"text":"very useful but according to the publishers they're going to reissue it with new color photos","words":[["very",362.61,363.19],["useful",363.19,363.71],["but",363.71,364.45],["according",364.45,364.89],["to",364.89,365.09],["the",365.09,365.21],["publishers",365.21,365.69],["they're",365.69,366.13],["going",366.13,366.27],["to",366.27,366.45],["reissue",366.45,367.11],["it",367.11,367.33],["with",367.33,367.57],["new",367.57,367.95],["color",367.95,368.39],["photos",368.39,368.89]]},{"start":368.89,"end":373.99,"text":"news, and at the moment it's out of print. There aren't any second-hand copies out there,","words":[["news,",368.89,369.03],["and",369.31,369.47],["at",369.47,369.55],["the",369.55,369.61],["moment",369.61,369.97],["it's",369.97,370.31],["out",370.31,370.43],["of",370.43,370.55],["print.",370.55,370.85],["There",371.51,371.75],["aren't",371.75,372.03],["any",372.03,372.23],["second",372.23,372.57],["-hand",372.57,372.91],["copies",372.91,373.35],["out",373.35,373.65],["there,",373.65,373.99]]},{"start":374.07,"end":376.33,"text":"so tell them not to waste time looking for it.","words":[["so",374.07,374.29],["tell",374.29,374.57],["them",374.57,374.75],["not",374.75,374.87],["to",374.87,375.03],["waste",375.03,375.23],["time",375.23,375.55],["looking",375.55,375.81],["for",375.81,376.15],["it.",376.15,376.33]]},{"start":376.55,"end":378.89,"text":"Oh, right. I didn't know that.","words":[["Oh,",376.55,376.81],["right.",377.21,377.49],["I",378.05,378.25],["didn't",378.25,378.45],["know",378.45,378.67],["that.",378.67,378.89]]},{"start":380.01,"end":386.31,"text":"There's one more that I want to mention, and that's confident voice delivery. It exaggerates","words":[["There's",380.01,380.29],["one",380.29,380.51],["more",380.51,380.91],["that",380.91,381.19],["I",381.19,381.33],["want",381.33,381.53],["to",381.53,381.87],["mention,",381.87,382.27],["and",382.55,382.73],["that's",382.73,383.11],["confident",383.11,383.77],["voice",383.77,384.37],["delivery.",384.37,384.83],["It",385.45,385.59],["exaggerates",385.59,386.31]]},{"start":386.31,"end":391.57,"text":"its claims on how to be successful to such an extent that I think it is positively misleading.","words":[["its",386.31,386.49],["claims",386.49,386.91],["on",386.91,387.15],["how",387.15,387.43],["to",387.43,387.61],["be",387.61,387.75],["successful",387.75,388.31],["to",388.31,388.51],["such",388.51,388.71],["an",388.71,388.87],["extent",388.87,389.35],["that",389.35,389.73],["I",389.73,389.93],["think",389.93,390.17],["it",390.17,390.33],["is",390.33,390.45],["positively",390.45,391.11],["misleading.",391.11,391.57]]},{"start":392.57,"end":394.17,"text":"But maybe I'm biased.","words":[["But",392.57,393.05],["maybe",393.05,393.63],["I'm",393.63,393.85],["biased.",393.85,394.17]]},{"start":395.05,"end":397.41,"text":"Okay, I'll make a note of that, thanks.","words":[["Okay,",395.05,395.61],["I'll",395.97,396.25],["make",396.25,396.45],["a",396.45,396.57],["note",396.57,396.77],["of",396.77,396.91],["that,",396.91,397.07],["thanks.",397.29,397.41]]},{"start":398.09,"end":399.53,"text":"So, the others...","words":[["So,",398.09,398.51],["the",398.65,398.81],["others...",398.81,399.53]]},{"start":402.47,"end":404.51,"text":"That is the end of Part 3.","words":[["That",402.47,403.05],["is",403.05,403.23],["the",403.23,403.41],["end",403.41,403.67],["of",403.67,403.83],["Part",403.83,404.11],["3.",404.11,404.51]]},{"start":405.29,"end":409.45,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["You",405.29,405.55],["now",405.55,405.79],["have",405.79,406.09],["30",406.09,406.57],["seconds",406.57,407.07],["to",407.07,407.63],["check",407.63,407.91],["your",407.91,408.11],["answers",408.11,408.47],["to",408.47,408.79],["Part",408.79,409.05],["3.",409.05,409.45]]}]}